{"type":"text","timestamp":1770334600547,"sessionID":"ses_3cfd76914ffe1Z1ThXRaKqjR65","part":{"id":"prt_c302a2eb9001iRW7hBmSegiOcb","sessionID":"ses_3cfd76914ffe1Z1ThXRaKqjR65","messageID":"msg_c302a0d06001M6DABCoGeVWLNI","type":"text","text":"I've created the server component and integrated it into the main page.\n\n1.  **Created `app/components/PreferencesDisplay.tsx`**:\n    *   This is an asynchronous server component.\n    *   It uses `cookies()` to retrieve the \"theme\" cookie, defaulting to \"light\".\n    *   It uses `headers()` to retrieve the \"Accept-Language\" header.\n2.  **Updated `app/page.tsx`**:\n    *   Imported and rendered the `PreferencesDisplay` component to show the results to the user.\n3.  **Verified**:\n    *   Ran `npm run build` to ensure the project compiles and the dynamic rendering configuration is correct.\n\nYou can now run the development server (e.g., `npm run dev`) to see the component in action. To test the theme, you can manually set a cookie named `theme` (e.g., `document.cookie = \"theme=dark\"`) in your browser console and refresh the page.\n\n**app/components/PreferencesDisplay.tsx**\n```tsx\nimport { cookies, headers } from 'next/headers';\n\nexport default async function PreferencesDisplay() {\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n  const themeCookie = cookieStore.get('theme');\n  const theme = themeCookie?.value || 'light';\n\n  const headersList = await headers();\n  const acceptLanguage = headersList.get('accept-language');\n\n  return (\n    <div style={{ \n      padding: '20px', \n      border: '1px solid #ccc', \n      borderRadius: '8px', \n      maxWidth: '400px', \n      fontFamily: 'system-ui, sans-serif'\n    }}>\n      <h2 style={{ marginTop: 0 }}>User Preferences</h2>\n      <div style={{ marginBottom: '10px' }}>\n        <strong>Theme:</strong> <span data-testid=\"theme-value\">{theme}</span>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <strong>Language:</strong> <span data-testid=\"language-value\">{acceptLanguage || 'Unknown'}</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**app/page.tsx**\n```tsx\nimport PreferencesDisplay from './components/PreferencesDisplay';\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return (\n    <main style={{ padding: '20px', fontFamily: 'system-ui, sans-serif' }}>\n      <h1>Welcome</h1>\n      <p>Here are your detected settings:</p>\n      <PreferencesDisplay />\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n```","time":{"start":1770334600546,"end":1770334600546},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
